/Author (Wenxin Li) /CreationDate (D:20260504143340+00'00') /Creator (reportlab) /Keywords (coordination knowledge substrate, CKS, linear-cost scaling, size-independence, governance cost, substrate size, rule variety, intervention frequency, workload, cost dimensions, defensive publication, prior art, Wenxin Li) /ModDate (D:20260504143340+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (Defensive publication of public prior art derived from the Coordination Knowledge Substrate \(CKS\) pattern. Formalizes the four-dimension cost structure \(substrate size, rule variety, intervention frequency, workload\) and the size-independence-of-governance guarantee as the integrating frame for the linear-cost scaling commitment \(Claim 5\) of the source paper.) /Title (The Linear-Cost Scaling Commitment: Full Operational Treatment of Cost Dimensions and the Size-Independence Guarantee in the Coordination Knowledge Substrate Pattern) /Trapped /False
